WEBVTT

01:26.020 --> 01:31.590
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.590
[Episode 11: Sentiments Blooming in Moonlight]

01:40.960 --> 01:42.516
This can't do.

01:42.540 --> 01:44.500
These papers will become worthless soon.

01:46.140 --> 01:46.946
Yes.

01:46.970 --> 01:48.690
This is such a big loss.

01:49.190 --> 01:51.190
What should we do?

01:56.480 --> 01:57.446
Everyone.

01:57.470 --> 01:59.746
I've sent someone to investigate the rumor

01:59.770 --> 02:01.896
about the attack on the trade caravan.

02:01.920 --> 02:04.476
There is no conclusive news yet.

02:04.500 --> 02:05.996
But remember,

02:06.020 --> 02:08.405
the Chamber of Commerce will keep my promise.

02:08.429 --> 02:11.046
Any merchant who fails to redeem the raw silk

02:11.070 --> 02:13.916
after the deadline will be refunded

02:13.940 --> 02:15.966
at the same price as the date of sale.

02:15.990 --> 02:18.710
So you won't suffer any loss.

02:18.730 --> 02:23.526
And the pledge is not due until tomorrow.

02:23.550 --> 02:25.990
Why can't you keep it

02:26.040 --> 02:27.670
for one more day?

02:27.710 --> 02:29.606
If the rumor is true,

02:29.630 --> 02:31.836
everyone will rush to redeem it tomorrow.

02:31.860 --> 02:34.906
I'm afraid the pledge will become useless by then.

02:34.930 --> 02:35.476
Yes.

02:35.500 --> 02:37.000
You must pay us back today.

02:37.020 --> 02:37.686
Yes.

02:37.710 --> 02:39.910
That's right. Refund! Refund!

02:40.430 --> 02:41.310
Refund! Refund!

02:41.310 --> 02:43.390
Calm down, everyone.

02:43.670 --> 02:46.790
Chairperson Su will address your concerns.

02:52.700 --> 02:55.406
Heaven favors diligence, business favors trustworthiness.

02:55.430 --> 02:58.676
Today, I pledge my family's century-old business

02:58.700 --> 03:01.216
and my role as the Chairperson as collateral.

03:01.240 --> 03:03.626
If someone fails to redeem their

03:03.650 --> 03:05.226
raw silk or receive compensation tomorrow,

03:05.250 --> 03:08.286
I will sell my family business

03:08.310 --> 03:10.246
and give up my position as the Chairperson

03:10.270 --> 03:11.950
to compensate everyone.

03:12.430 --> 03:15.006
But the batch of raw silk is missing now.

03:15.030 --> 03:17.116
How promising can it be tomorrow?

03:17.140 --> 03:18.406
That's right.

03:18.430 --> 03:24.996
Pay us! Pay us!

03:25.020 --> 03:27.859
The news of the attack on the Su caravan has spread.

03:28.280 --> 03:31.130
People crowded outside Su Family's doors early this morning.

03:35.870 --> 03:37.566
Why do you sigh?

03:37.590 --> 03:41.310
Did you also buy the Su’s pledge?

03:42.260 --> 03:45.090
I don't understand and I don't want to get involved.

03:45.290 --> 03:48.970
But Miss Su has always been kind to people.

03:49.170 --> 03:51.846
I don't know who she offended this time

03:51.870 --> 03:54.026
to cause the Su family to suffer this way.

03:54.050 --> 03:55.500
Really?

03:57.530 --> 03:59.950
You must have made the clothes

04:00.140 --> 04:01.940
worn by everyone in the Su family.

04:04.090 --> 04:05.926
Yes, ever since I was an apprentice.

04:05.950 --> 04:07.560
It has been 40 years since then.

04:08.180 --> 04:09.790
No matter how the world changes,

04:10.030 --> 04:11.756
we shouldn't give craftsmen a hard time.

04:11.780 --> 04:14.020
If the Su family falls,

04:14.320 --> 04:16.976
you shall be in charge of making clothes for

04:17.000 --> 04:19.520
the Cao Sect's members and families.

04:20.210 --> 04:22.030
Thank you, Master Qi.

04:24.980 --> 04:28.780
[At 5 a.m. tonight, the raw silk will reach the Double Stone Pier in the east of the city]

04:33.790 --> 04:34.856
When profit is prioritised,

04:34.880 --> 04:37.760
Mr. Mo is indeed responsible.

04:40.100 --> 04:41.980
Any other news?

04:43.780 --> 04:46.775
Today, some escaping escorts returned to the city.

04:46.799 --> 04:48.666
According to them, the caravan was forced

04:48.690 --> 04:50.210
into an abandoned inn by the bandits.

04:50.290 --> 04:52.970
But they did not expect that the bandits had

04:53.010 --> 04:54.436
dug a tunnel to ambush them in the chaos.

04:54.460 --> 04:56.650
They even burned all the raw silk.

04:58.799 --> 05:00.646
It's not an elaborate plan,

05:00.670 --> 05:02.120
but it's enough.

05:02.590 --> 05:04.100
Any casualties?

05:05.380 --> 05:07.166
If the rumor were true, the caravan would be able

05:07.190 --> 05:10.820
to repel several large groups of bandits.

05:10.890 --> 05:13.520
They must have suffered great damage.

05:13.960 --> 05:16.170
Anyway, we did not receive any news

05:16.250 --> 05:17.900
of your friends' whereabouts yet.

05:19.740 --> 05:21.540
Thank you for your hospitality over the past few days.

05:21.780 --> 05:23.306
I'll take my leave.

05:23.330 --> 05:24.780
Wait, Young Master.

05:26.600 --> 05:28.410
It's better for you to stay.

05:28.770 --> 05:29.666
Why?

05:29.690 --> 05:32.826
Mr. Mo said before the truth is out,

05:32.850 --> 05:35.910
someone must be desperate to behead you.

05:37.010 --> 05:38.460
Don't worry about me.

05:39.370 --> 05:41.350
Take good care of Mr. Mo.

06:01.370 --> 06:02.820
Rong,

06:03.270 --> 06:06.526
is the rumor true?

06:06.550 --> 06:08.340
Don't worry, my lady.

06:08.520 --> 06:09.970
Someone really saw

06:10.010 --> 06:11.466
Shu Yanan and Jin Biao

06:11.490 --> 06:12.896
escort him out of the encirclement.

06:12.920 --> 06:14.496
But right now, I really can't tell

06:14.520 --> 06:17.050
if this was part of Young Master Xiang's plan.

06:17.180 --> 06:18.940
He's from Yuntai.

06:19.670 --> 06:22.386
Everyone can be his pawn.

06:22.410 --> 06:24.170
Confidants mean nothing to him.

06:24.630 --> 06:26.080
This can't do.

06:26.260 --> 06:27.800
I'm going to look for Mingyu.

06:29.270 --> 06:30.720
My lady.

06:39.440 --> 06:43.030
[Liansheng House]

06:52.860 --> 06:54.580
If the rumor were true, the caravan would be able

06:54.670 --> 06:58.380
to repel several large groups of bandits.

06:58.430 --> 07:00.890
They must have suffered great damage.

07:01.670 --> 07:05.790
Anyway, we did not receive any news of your friends' whereabouts yet.

07:05.930 --> 07:07.380
Mr. Yun.

07:19.350 --> 07:22.290
Has anyone come to seek me recently?

07:23.080 --> 07:24.720
Chairperson Su was here.

07:25.300 --> 07:28.970
She said to let her know if you're back.

07:29.870 --> 07:32.610
I've been back for four hours.

07:32.880 --> 07:34.330
Why are you still here?

07:35.500 --> 07:37.250
The Su family is in chaos

07:37.490 --> 07:39.360
because of my plan.

07:39.670 --> 07:41.430
You're afraid they'll make things difficult for me.

07:43.440 --> 07:44.900
I believe you didn't mean

07:45.420 --> 07:47.380
for things to turn out this way.

07:51.350 --> 07:55.030
It's been half a month since I bought this place.

07:55.910 --> 07:57.880
How are preparations for the opening?

08:00.000 --> 08:01.590
I feel relieved

08:02.230 --> 08:03.646
to hear you ask about that.

08:03.670 --> 08:05.750
If you had other intentions, you wouldn't

08:06.170 --> 08:09.330
have let Sister Shu and Brother Jin escort him.

08:10.470 --> 08:12.070
When Mr. Su comes back,

08:12.310 --> 08:15.100
I'll arrange for the opening.

08:17.000 --> 08:18.830
What if Mr. Su can't come back?

08:32.420 --> 08:34.270
If Sister Shu can't come back,

08:35.860 --> 08:38.370
what will you do?

08:41.929 --> 08:43.379
I'm feeling a bit drunk.

08:43.830 --> 08:45.370
I'm going back to rest.

09:35.230 --> 09:36.680
Qian Rong.

09:37.500 --> 09:39.340
Yanwu Master once said,

09:39.510 --> 09:41.990
no one can counter this move within ten breaths.

09:42.590 --> 09:44.206
You people from Yuntai

09:44.230 --> 09:46.990
are too arrogant to know the world.

09:47.620 --> 09:50.810
No wonder they say that no one in Nandu City

09:51.030 --> 09:52.510
dares to take on the Su family by force.

09:52.510 --> 09:54.270
They are all wrong.

09:54.460 --> 09:56.170
No one dares to take on my lady

09:56.640 --> 09:58.560
regardless of methods.

09:59.640 --> 10:01.160
If you kill me,

10:01.230 --> 10:03.206
aren't you afraid that my sect will take revenge?

10:03.230 --> 10:05.406
I have killed countless people in the past.

10:05.430 --> 10:06.880
I've managed to live till now.

10:07.000 --> 10:10.530
But I can return my life to Su's Residence anytime.

10:12.150 --> 10:13.830
Dare to have a bet with me?

10:14.100 --> 10:15.550
Kill me,

10:15.710 --> 10:16.996
and see how long it takes for

10:17.020 --> 10:18.780
my people from Yuntai to find the murderer,

10:18.990 --> 10:21.190
and if the Su family will be implicated.

10:30.710 --> 10:32.160
You dare not gamble with me?

10:32.870 --> 10:36.120
Talk to me properly if you dare not.

10:53.210 --> 10:55.020
You're so reckless.

10:55.090 --> 10:57.190
This must not be your chairperson's order.

11:02.170 --> 11:04.740
For the sake of the Su's Residence,

11:05.420 --> 11:07.640
my lady has neglected and damaged her health.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.990
When she's meeting people or receiving goods,

11:10.580 --> 11:12.730
she always dresses herself up

11:12.860 --> 11:15.590
so that no outsiders can tell she's ill.

11:16.630 --> 11:19.846
If anything happens to the Su's Residence,

11:19.870 --> 11:22.030
or any harm is done to my lady because of you,

11:24.300 --> 11:26.350
I will kill you.

11:30.740 --> 11:32.190
In that case,

11:34.470 --> 11:36.590
I've saved my life.

11:41.070 --> 11:46.490
[Double Stone Pier]

11:53.900 --> 11:55.350
Pirates.

11:56.430 --> 11:57.366
Don't panic.

11:57.390 --> 11:58.816
Light the beacon

11:58.840 --> 12:00.420
and convey the military information.

12:24.610 --> 12:26.130
At 5 a.m. today,

12:26.580 --> 12:28.466
raw silk will be transported by sea to the

12:28.490 --> 12:31.010
abandoned Double Stone Pier in the east of the city.

12:32.390 --> 12:33.926
What if it can't make it?

12:33.950 --> 12:35.916
It's easy for you to kill me.

12:35.940 --> 12:37.840
I wouldn't dare to lie to you.

12:39.410 --> 12:40.456
So, from the beginning,

12:40.480 --> 12:43.380
you've decided to take the sea route.

12:44.100 --> 12:45.776
The caravan sent to Yangzhou

12:45.800 --> 12:47.850
was just your bait.

12:48.560 --> 12:50.426
It's inappropriate to call them my bait.

12:50.450 --> 12:51.900
In war, you have to deceive your foes.

12:52.280 --> 12:54.280
I'm just going with the flow

12:54.310 --> 12:55.850
and taking advantage of the situation.

12:56.370 --> 12:57.896
Since ancient times, planners have always

12:57.920 --> 13:00.440
pretended to be bad at the things they are good at

13:00.510 --> 13:02.270
and concealed what they have utilized.

13:02.580 --> 13:04.046
A planner's intentions must be hard to read

13:04.070 --> 13:05.290
and he must only strike after he has planned.

13:05.310 --> 13:07.120
Only then, can he win in a single move.

13:09.730 --> 13:11.640
No matter how you avoid the topic,

13:11.950 --> 13:15.940
you cannot hide the fact that people from Yuntai are hardhearted.

13:18.370 --> 13:20.286
My lady was right.

13:20.310 --> 13:21.446
In your eyes,

13:21.470 --> 13:24.440
everyone is a pawn.

13:26.020 --> 13:27.890
No one who has achieved greatness in history

13:28.090 --> 13:30.230
has done so by prioritizing one moment over another.

13:30.780 --> 13:32.460
As for the Su family's caravan, the coachmen drove

13:32.600 --> 13:34.706
the carriages and the escorts protected them.

13:34.730 --> 13:36.036
Everyone was doing their job.

13:36.060 --> 13:38.016
It was no different from what they usually do.

13:38.040 --> 13:39.476
It's just that they happened to walk into

13:39.500 --> 13:41.200
a part of my plan.

13:41.580 --> 13:43.500
If something had really gone wrong,

13:44.170 --> 13:45.930
I would have heavily compensated for it.

13:47.850 --> 13:49.370
In your eyes,

13:49.910 --> 13:51.940
money can solve everything.

13:52.730 --> 13:55.810
You can make up for lost pawns with money.

13:56.500 --> 13:58.590
But what if you lost close pawns like

13:58.590 --> 14:01.390
Shu Yanan and Jin Biao?

14:04.500 --> 14:06.540
How will you make up for them?

14:10.390 --> 14:13.110
Do you have a better way, Mr. Qian?

14:13.750 --> 14:14.276
Or

14:14.300 --> 14:17.240
even if Qi Tianfeng wins the battle of raw silk,

14:17.310 --> 14:17.960
the Su Family

14:17.980 --> 14:20.460
still has a way to escape unscathed

14:20.620 --> 14:22.070
and safe?

14:32.290 --> 14:34.630
So you mean

14:35.060 --> 14:36.920
I should thank you instead?

14:38.230 --> 14:39.680
Shouldn't you?

14:41.810 --> 14:44.000
That remains to be seen.

14:44.990 --> 14:46.110
If the raw silk can safely

14:46.110 --> 14:48.350
arrive at the dock today,

14:49.400 --> 14:51.700
you'll be safe.

14:53.710 --> 14:57.690
Otherwise, I will take that

14:58.830 --> 15:00.650
intelligent head of yours.

15:26.660 --> 15:28.010
Have you checked the raw silk inventory

15:28.030 --> 15:29.906
of the Cao Sect?

15:29.930 --> 15:31.376
We've done it as you said.

15:31.400 --> 15:33.626
But we don't understand.

15:33.650 --> 15:35.356
Now that the pledge cannot be fulfilled,

15:35.380 --> 15:37.750
the price of in-stock raw silk will increase.

15:37.950 --> 15:40.750
Why are you in a hurry to sell them now?

15:42.540 --> 15:45.530
An item bought at a discount is already cheaper.

15:45.600 --> 15:48.526
An item sold during a price hike is already more expensive.

15:48.550 --> 15:51.316
This is a business trick.

15:51.340 --> 15:53.140
You don't need to understand it.

15:53.200 --> 15:55.326
Just do as you're told.

15:55.350 --> 15:56.486
Yes.

15:56.060 --> 16:02.290
[Nandu Chamber of Commerce]

16:08.490 --> 16:09.940
Mr. Qian.

16:10.470 --> 16:11.920
Steward Ding.

16:12.550 --> 16:14.280
Have a seat.

16:15.590 --> 16:17.760
The deadline on the 15th has arrived.

16:18.500 --> 16:20.746
Here's the pledge for 30,000 catties of raw silk.

16:20.770 --> 16:25.316
According to the pledge, you need to pay 195,000 taels of silver.

16:25.340 --> 16:27.050
I didn’t expect the Cao Sect

16:27.660 --> 16:29.900
to acquire almost half of the pledge

16:30.490 --> 16:33.850
distributed by the Chamber of Commerce.

16:34.050 --> 16:35.970
Cash on delivery.

16:36.170 --> 16:38.586
Mr. Qian, I'm sure you won't make things

16:38.610 --> 16:41.360
difficult for an errand runner like me.

16:44.550 --> 16:47.586
Please go back and tell Master Qi,

16:47.610 --> 16:50.570
if he can make a comeback one day,

16:50.710 --> 16:51.806
I hope he knows that

16:51.830 --> 16:54.800
there's no guarantee of winning in this world.

16:55.310 --> 16:57.080
His ambition has blinded him.

16:57.140 --> 17:01.050
He didn't notice that he was in imminent peril.

17:02.350 --> 17:03.800
Steward Ding,

17:04.420 --> 17:07.099
take your 30,000 catties worth of pledge

17:07.130 --> 17:09.680
and exchange them for raw silk outside the Eastern City gate.

17:09.830 --> 17:11.695
All 30,000 catties of them

17:11.719 --> 17:15.280
are top-quality silk.

17:18.900 --> 17:22.536
[Pledge]

17:22.110 --> 17:22.985
Later,

17:23.009 --> 17:25.609
Steward Ding will bring tailor Wang over.

17:25.900 --> 17:27.235
Don't stand on ceremony.

17:27.259 --> 17:28.225
Pick the best fabric.

17:28.249 --> 17:29.810
Everyone gets a new set of clothes.

17:29.950 --> 17:31.586
If you have a wife and kids,

17:31.610 --> 17:33.060
they get new clothes too.

17:33.860 --> 17:35.456
Tell everyone.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.396
OK.

17:36.420 --> 17:37.626
Thank you, Master.

17:37.650 --> 17:39.100
Steward Ding.

17:40.420 --> 17:41.870
Your Master.

17:44.100 --> 17:45.550
We're in trouble.

17:48.170 --> 17:50.830
I held the pledge and thought about it while walking.

17:51.030 --> 17:53.990
I thought the Su family must be bluffing.

17:54.170 --> 17:55.846
But when I arrived at the city gate,

17:55.870 --> 17:58.230
the containers were piled up higher than the walls.

17:58.270 --> 18:00.620
How did they manage to import the goods?

18:01.160 --> 18:04.300
The Su's caravan was burnt to crisps.

18:04.710 --> 18:07.160
It's impossible to use the river channels.

18:07.270 --> 18:09.510
The only option left was the sea route.

18:10.010 --> 18:12.376
But the imperial court has banned sea activities for decades.

18:12.400 --> 18:14.430
Even without the military guards,

18:14.590 --> 18:15.550
where did the Su family

18:15.550 --> 18:17.510
get so many cargo ships?

18:18.190 --> 18:19.640
No, wait.

18:20.230 --> 18:22.520
There was a rumor this morning

18:24.390 --> 18:26.620
that pirates entered the river last night.

18:27.860 --> 18:29.700
Could it be them?

18:31.740 --> 18:33.190
Your Master.

18:33.480 --> 18:36.596
We guarded against land and river transport,

18:36.620 --> 18:39.796
but we never thought they would take the sea route.

18:39.820 --> 18:41.430
This is bad.

18:42.010 --> 18:45.650
We betted with everything Cao Sect has.

18:46.590 --> 18:48.040
Get up!

18:51.000 --> 18:52.450
Stand up!

18:55.500 --> 18:57.400
The Cao Sect does not shed tears.

19:09.140 --> 19:10.840
For this deal,

19:11.240 --> 19:14.850
the raw silk took 30,000 taels.

19:15.540 --> 19:17.860
As for hiring the pirate ships...

19:18.060 --> 19:20.726
That bastard, Master Guan, dared to blackmail me.

19:20.750 --> 19:22.870
He demanded 20,000 taels for payment.

19:23.740 --> 19:26.450
Qi Tianfeng borrowed about

19:26.510 --> 19:29.230
50,000 to 60,000 taels in total.

19:29.640 --> 19:30.386
We...

19:30.410 --> 19:32.910
We invested over 100,000 taels of silver.

19:34.860 --> 19:38.130
How much is the business of the Cao Sect worth?

19:38.960 --> 19:40.570
You don't understand.

19:40.780 --> 19:42.116
The Cao Sect's business

19:42.140 --> 19:44.246
can't be bought with money.

19:44.270 --> 19:45.246
Besides,

19:45.270 --> 19:47.956
the Su family owes me a big favor this time.

19:47.980 --> 19:50.420
It can’t be repaid with money either.

19:50.540 --> 19:54.020
Anyway, in the war of raw silk,

19:54.280 --> 19:58.800
the biggest beneficiary is us, Guanghui Bank.

20:04.030 --> 20:07.430
What benefit did Mr. Yun get?

20:10.020 --> 20:13.390
Was all this just to deal with Qi Tianfeng?

20:15.120 --> 20:18.306
You've raised a good point.

20:18.330 --> 20:21.236
He planned everything with utmost care.

20:21.260 --> 20:24.700
In the end, what did he leave for himself?

20:26.740 --> 20:28.346
He left a message before leaving.

20:28.370 --> 20:29.820
But I don't understand it.

20:31.740 --> 20:33.086
What did he say?

20:33.110 --> 20:36.230
He told me to keep you safe.

20:41.070 --> 20:42.520
Master.

20:46.390 --> 20:47.676
Master Qi of the Cao Sect is here.

20:47.700 --> 20:48.786
He wants to see you.

20:48.810 --> 20:50.206
Tell him to wait.

20:50.230 --> 20:51.680
Yes.

20:53.520 --> 20:56.160
Yun Xiang must be referring to him.

20:58.230 --> 21:00.690
The Iron Hand Demon.

21:02.030 --> 21:05.326
I finally get to face him in a fight.

21:05.350 --> 21:06.706
Kid.

21:06.730 --> 21:08.866
Look at you, all raring to go.

21:08.890 --> 21:10.116
Let me tell you.

21:10.140 --> 21:12.566
This person is no ordinary master.

21:12.590 --> 21:13.126
How about this?

21:13.150 --> 21:14.596
Let the shadowman suppress him first.

21:14.620 --> 21:16.630
Then, you can take him down when you get the chance.

21:16.710 --> 21:17.556
Uncle,

21:17.580 --> 21:19.096
I'm looking forward to it.

21:19.120 --> 21:21.246
His palms technique is known for its vicious strength.

21:21.270 --> 21:22.720
By fighting him,

21:23.070 --> 21:26.590
I can improve on my Transforming Palms.

21:44.670 --> 21:46.120
Mingyu.

21:50.920 --> 21:52.380
Where are you hurt?

21:52.510 --> 21:53.960
Sister.

21:54.590 --> 21:56.040
I'm fine.

21:57.780 --> 21:59.510
It's all somebody else's blood.

22:02.010 --> 22:03.460
I'm tired.

22:05.670 --> 22:07.390
Mingyu!

22:10.990 --> 22:12.556
What's wrong with Mingyu?

22:12.580 --> 22:14.060
Something's wrong with him.

22:15.590 --> 22:17.426
I think he should be fine.

22:17.450 --> 22:19.570
Young Master has always been kind.

22:20.140 --> 22:22.830
He must have killed someone.

22:24.550 --> 22:27.540
Let's give him some time to himself.

22:29.500 --> 22:30.950
By the way, my lady.

22:31.480 --> 22:33.106
Warrior Jin and Miss Shu

22:33.130 --> 22:34.660
are waiting for you inside.

22:40.270 --> 22:41.720
This is...

22:41.870 --> 22:43.110
A small leader of the Cao Sect.

22:43.130 --> 22:44.166
He's called Xie Guang.

22:44.190 --> 22:46.260
He set fire to the raw silk.

22:47.430 --> 22:48.880
Which fire?

22:52.240 --> 22:53.636
The one in Yufeng Warehouse,

22:53.660 --> 22:55.300
or the one with the caravan?

23:04.000 --> 23:05.830
What does it have to do with the Yufeng warehouse?

23:06.300 --> 23:07.830
Of course it's this time.

23:07.920 --> 23:09.916
Your brother is also stubborn.

23:09.940 --> 23:12.260
He won't give up even without the goods.

23:12.480 --> 23:14.046
He insisted that we follow the Cao Sect

23:14.070 --> 23:15.690
and nab a member back with us.

23:16.510 --> 23:17.626
Mr. Su said we can only report

23:17.650 --> 23:19.156
to the authorities if we have a witness.

23:19.180 --> 23:21.070
By doing that, even if you go bankrupt,

23:21.070 --> 23:22.990
Qi Tianfeng won't be able to rest in peace.

23:23.030 --> 23:24.006
But I told him that

23:24.030 --> 23:25.556
this person wouldn't talk so easily.

23:25.580 --> 23:26.776
He refused to believe me.

23:26.800 --> 23:28.236
Forget it.

23:28.260 --> 23:29.730
It's nothing important.

23:30.870 --> 23:32.126
Chairperson Su,

23:32.150 --> 23:35.100
we almost died this time.

23:35.750 --> 23:37.246
We didn't bring the raw silk back.

23:37.270 --> 23:39.190
I won't ask for the goods escorting fee.

23:39.420 --> 23:41.116
But I killed at least 30 people

23:41.140 --> 23:43.156
to protect your brother.

23:43.180 --> 23:45.540
That will be 10 taels of gold per kill.

23:46.200 --> 23:48.166
Hero Jin, you risked your life in the fight.

23:48.190 --> 23:50.510
I'm willing to pay double.

23:51.010 --> 23:53.060
Thank you, Chairperson Su.

23:53.670 --> 23:55.120
Miss Shu.

23:57.610 --> 23:59.530
How should I repay you?

24:05.650 --> 24:07.290
According to the trade contract,

24:07.320 --> 24:08.686
if the armed escorts lose the goods,

24:08.710 --> 24:10.146
not only do they not get any payment,

24:10.170 --> 24:11.890
they must also pay for the lost goods.

24:11.940 --> 24:14.806
But they lost a lot this time.

24:14.830 --> 24:16.026
If they still have to compensate for the goods,

24:16.050 --> 24:18.290
I'm afraid the Armed Escort Agency will close down for good.

24:18.440 --> 24:20.506
Once a contract is made, it must be followed.

24:20.530 --> 24:22.010
This is the rule of business.

24:22.110 --> 24:24.890
But I can thank you in my own name.

24:24.970 --> 24:27.846
I will return the compensation sum

24:27.870 --> 24:29.476
and make the agreed payment.

24:29.500 --> 24:31.426
As for any dead or injured escorts,

24:31.450 --> 24:34.840
I'm willing to compensate their families.

24:36.780 --> 24:39.686
No wonder you've been in charge of the Chamber of Commerce for so many years.

24:39.710 --> 24:41.160
You're a chivalrous person.

24:41.310 --> 24:42.760
I admire you.

24:42.790 --> 24:44.096
Please keep your promise.

24:44.120 --> 24:45.590
We'll be leaving now.

24:50.620 --> 24:52.460
Did you know about this before?

24:53.790 --> 24:56.976
This caravan was a bait for Yun Xiang to make a diversion.

24:57.000 --> 24:58.680
If you knew,

24:58.720 --> 25:00.950
why did you risk your life for it?

25:02.780 --> 25:03.956
Yun Xiang...

25:03.980 --> 25:05.660
is capable of anything.

25:06.860 --> 25:08.476
Fortunately, the result is not bad.

25:08.500 --> 25:09.950
You'll get used to it.

25:22.790 --> 25:23.646
Young Master.

25:23.670 --> 25:25.176
Two ladies have been waiting for you

25:25.200 --> 25:26.650
at the backyard door for a while now.

25:49.870 --> 25:51.320
Miss.

26:03.110 --> 26:04.560
I shall go back first.

26:15.280 --> 26:16.730
You're hurt.

26:16.790 --> 26:18.240
Don't touch it.

26:19.550 --> 26:21.000
It's all blood.

26:22.270 --> 26:23.720
It's dirty.

26:30.790 --> 26:32.860
You've never seen me like this, have you?

26:33.830 --> 26:35.280
Don't worry.

26:36.030 --> 26:37.480
It's all minor injuries.

26:38.760 --> 26:40.680
Your magnolia protected me.

26:45.250 --> 26:47.210
You sound so calm.

26:48.110 --> 26:52.070
But you must have suffered a lot.

26:59.910 --> 27:01.600
Tell me about your trip

27:02.110 --> 27:03.870
someday.

27:06.790 --> 27:08.380
You might not like it.

27:09.590 --> 27:12.870
The world is full of heroic emotions.

27:13.110 --> 27:15.096
I used to love

27:15.120 --> 27:16.620
reading about them in books.

27:19.160 --> 27:23.670
I didn't expect you to be a hero too.

27:34.830 --> 27:36.566
It's been some long tiring days.

27:36.590 --> 27:38.486
Let me buy you a drink.

27:38.510 --> 27:39.286
It'll relieve your fatigue.

27:39.310 --> 27:41.286
You're only buying me a drink after earning so much?

27:41.310 --> 27:44.530
You should at least treat me to a boat dinner.

27:45.110 --> 27:45.966
Let's do that next time.

27:45.990 --> 27:47.630
I'll go back to Liansheng House first.

27:48.410 --> 27:50.260
I know why you're going back.

27:50.310 --> 27:52.070
You're probably wrong.

27:52.320 --> 27:53.316
You're either going to meet someone,

27:53.340 --> 27:55.060
or wait for someone.

27:55.550 --> 27:57.000
Miss.

28:01.910 --> 28:03.550
I think you have one too.

28:05.110 --> 28:07.216
Your hands never shake when you behead people.

28:07.240 --> 28:09.400
Yet you blush when she smiles at you?

28:09.830 --> 28:11.690
Let's go. I'll lend you some courage.

28:12.780 --> 28:14.230
Miss Shu.

28:17.660 --> 28:19.110
Jin.

28:19.160 --> 28:21.030
I'm glad you're back safely.

28:30.460 --> 28:32.846
She insisted on coming with me.

28:32.870 --> 28:34.510
But she doesn't say anything now that she's here.

28:36.160 --> 28:39.230
How about I buy everyone a drink?

28:41.090 --> 28:43.850
I need to tend to some chores at the Liansheng House.

28:43.870 --> 28:44.756
Go ahead.

28:44.780 --> 28:46.700
I'm tired too.

28:48.070 --> 28:48.766
Let's drink.

28:48.790 --> 28:50.706
You're busy. You can't go.

28:50.730 --> 28:52.180
What am I busy with?

28:56.110 --> 28:57.710
Rest early.

28:58.270 --> 29:00.980
You must be tired.

29:04.140 --> 29:07.000
You can just treat Tianhu to a drink instead.

29:07.280 --> 29:09.520
Miss Ke, let's go back to Liansheng House.

29:21.590 --> 29:23.040
Jin.

29:23.110 --> 29:25.606
I won't drink today.

29:25.630 --> 29:27.650
I have to help with work when I get back.

29:27.930 --> 29:30.890
Okay, it's up to you.

29:32.530 --> 29:34.250
For now, we...

29:35.820 --> 29:37.820
Let's take a walk.

29:38.280 --> 29:40.056
I've been in Nandu City for years.

29:40.080 --> 29:42.086
But this is my first time

29:42.110 --> 29:43.710
strolling on the street like this.

29:45.080 --> 29:46.406
You're not in a rush,

29:46.430 --> 29:48.870
why can't you take a stroll?

29:49.520 --> 29:51.246
It's a little embarrassing,

29:51.270 --> 29:52.886
but people of our background

29:52.910 --> 29:54.616
don't feel completely safe

29:54.640 --> 29:56.320
even in broad daylight.

29:57.270 --> 29:59.096
Let's stroll to your heart's content today.

29:59.120 --> 30:00.570
I'll protect you.

30:06.360 --> 30:11.586
[Peace and Virtuous]

30:06.750 --> 30:07.516
Jin.

30:07.540 --> 30:09.220
Where is your hometown?

30:09.470 --> 30:12.040
It's a bit complicated.

30:11.610 --> 30:15.770
[Liansheng House]

30:51.190 --> 30:52.640
Mr. Yun.

30:57.310 --> 31:00.070
Miss Shu is taking a bath inside.

31:00.350 --> 31:02.710
I was just leaving for a brief moment,

31:02.930 --> 31:04.890
so I didn't lock the door for her.

31:07.740 --> 31:09.190
Tianhu.

31:09.660 --> 31:11.246
Give him the hot water.

31:11.270 --> 31:12.830
Go back and rest.

31:52.370 --> 31:53.840
Slide the bucket in.

32:16.390 --> 32:18.086
My life-long innocence,

32:18.110 --> 32:19.860
ruined in an instant.

32:23.400 --> 32:25.490
Have you ever been innocent?

32:28.620 --> 32:30.256
You called me here in such a hurry.

32:30.280 --> 32:31.890
You must have something urgent to tell me.

32:31.920 --> 32:33.970
I met Su Huairou just now.

32:34.270 --> 32:36.030
Although she didn't say it outright,

32:36.860 --> 32:38.560
I think

32:39.100 --> 32:42.070
she has figured out the whole story.

32:42.750 --> 32:44.200
What makes you think so?

32:44.820 --> 32:47.620
I don't know. It's just my instinct.

32:48.870 --> 32:51.020
But my instincts are always accurate.

33:05.850 --> 33:07.300
Yanan.

33:11.350 --> 33:13.550
Can you promise me one thing?

33:16.150 --> 33:19.190
Just tell me what you want to do.

33:20.550 --> 33:22.390
If Qian Rong wants to kill me,

33:22.870 --> 33:24.390
don't do anything.

33:24.970 --> 33:26.880
In case you lose your life.

33:29.350 --> 33:30.800
Did he come to you?

33:32.480 --> 33:34.760
I thought with my skills,

33:35.250 --> 33:37.370
I could protect myself within ten moves.

33:37.820 --> 33:40.240
But I couldn't even last one exchange with him.

33:41.920 --> 33:43.840
I didn't expect

33:44.930 --> 33:46.500
him to be such a skilled fighter.

33:48.420 --> 33:49.870
So...

34:08.990 --> 34:10.440
You must...

34:44.460 --> 34:46.200
Why are you looking at me like that?

34:46.319 --> 34:47.769
I'm fine.

34:50.339 --> 34:51.789
What about you?

34:53.750 --> 34:56.229
I'm still in front of you.

35:06.910 --> 35:08.700
What if I didn't come back?

35:17.550 --> 35:19.016
I shouldn't have asked.

35:19.040 --> 35:20.606
I've been like this for decades.

35:20.630 --> 35:22.206
I've never been safe.

35:22.230 --> 35:23.326
My survival depends on luck.

35:23.350 --> 35:24.800
This time was no exception.

35:28.500 --> 35:30.230
I just want to know.

35:30.990 --> 35:32.790
If I did not make it back.

35:33.460 --> 35:35.350
Neither did Jin Biao

35:36.870 --> 35:38.520
nor Su Mingyu make it back.

35:40.110 --> 35:41.560
Will your heart

35:43.150 --> 35:45.280
still remain unmoving?

35:52.890 --> 35:56.300
You're right. You're insanely smart.

35:56.980 --> 35:58.446
You want revenge,

35:58.470 --> 36:00.210
so you must focus on the big picture.

36:03.090 --> 36:05.790
It doesn't matter if others die in vain.

36:07.570 --> 36:09.930
As long as your wish comes true.

36:23.130 --> 36:24.740
Did you know?

36:27.030 --> 36:28.480
These past few days,

36:29.560 --> 36:31.190
I couldn't sleep well.

36:31.820 --> 36:33.270
I've always been calm.

36:34.120 --> 36:36.290
So I kept imagining

36:36.770 --> 36:38.410
what would happen to me

36:38.900 --> 36:40.350
if something happened to you.

36:40.870 --> 36:42.590
I thought I would be numb

36:43.510 --> 36:45.110
to the pain after a few times.

36:47.620 --> 36:49.070
But no.

36:50.970 --> 36:52.420
I don't believe you.

36:52.790 --> 36:53.786
Who knows how many people you've deceived

36:53.810 --> 36:55.540
with your sweet talk.

36:55.610 --> 36:57.810
Do you ever speak the truth?

36:59.940 --> 37:03.230
You still think I'm lying to you now?

37:04.420 --> 37:06.550
You said your instincts are the most accurate.

37:06.740 --> 37:09.220
Look at me and answer me.

37:11.840 --> 37:15.810
Am I lying to you?

37:26.870 --> 37:28.320
I can't tell.

37:35.820 --> 37:37.270
How about now?

37:44.620 --> 37:47.240
People from Yuntai must not fall in love.

37:49.670 --> 37:51.120
You broke a rule.

37:53.660 --> 37:55.610
Maybe I've lost

37:56.690 --> 37:58.140
ever since that gaze in Baiju Town.

38:00.030 --> 38:01.480
Nonsense.

38:02.970 --> 38:05.060
If someone from Yuntai wants to hide something,

38:05.510 --> 38:07.470
they can hide it till they die.

38:07.980 --> 38:09.880
I thought I knew everything.

38:10.250 --> 38:11.730
I thought I could devise a strategy for every situation.

38:12.690 --> 38:14.140
But you, and only you.

38:17.510 --> 38:18.970
You're too hard to figure out.

38:22.110 --> 38:23.770
Have you figured me out now?

38:25.610 --> 38:29.140
You always say that I only know how to lie

38:29.700 --> 38:31.066
and set up everything.

38:31.090 --> 38:33.290
Then why are you willing to risk your life

38:33.590 --> 38:35.040
for such a person?

38:43.230 --> 38:44.680
What are you doing?

38:47.300 --> 38:48.750
I'm a little afraid to

38:50.010 --> 38:51.760
look into your eyes.

38:56.830 --> 38:58.280
Forget it.

38:59.130 --> 39:02.500
There's no need to say it if you don't say it now.

39:20.610 --> 39:23.406
♫ Yumen mountains stack together ♫

39:23.430 --> 39:27.266
♫ Beacon towers spread all over the mountains ♫

39:27.290 --> 39:30.200
♫ People depended on beacon fires on the frontier ♫

39:30.220 --> 39:33.456
♫ Horses disappeared into the mountains ♫

39:33.480 --> 39:39.940
♫ Spring and rain are in our hearts ♫

39:42.020 --> 39:45.390
♫ Locking two doors to our hearts ♫

39:45.410 --> 39:48.696
♫ More wrinkles appear on my forehead ♫

39:48.720 --> 39:52.076
♫ I was so anxious ♫

39:52.100 --> 39:55.416
♫ I feared the wind would blow away my fate ♫

39:55.440 --> 39:58.776
♫ People come and go ♫

39:58.800 --> 40:02.136
♫ Turning around once in a lifetime ♫

40:02.160 --> 40:04.996
♫ From now on, the door to my heart ♫

40:05.020 --> 40:10.546
♫ Will not entertain anyone else ♫

40:10.570 --> 40:13.370
♫ The fading sunlight is reflected in the water ♫

40:13.390 --> 40:17.206
♫ Half the river was seemingly red ♫

40:17.230 --> 40:20.170
♫ A pity in the third night of September ♫

40:20.190 --> 40:23.486
♫ The dew looked like pearls and the moon like a bow ♫

40:23.510 --> 40:28.836
♫ Rain poured in our hearts ♫

40:28.860 --> 40:32.236
♫ Locking two doors to our hearts ♫

40:30.100 --> 40:33.450
People may look at us as companions

40:32.260 --> 40:35.526
♫ More wrinkles appear on my forehead ♫

40:34.100 --> 40:35.740
or partners.

40:35.550 --> 40:38.876
♫ I was so anxious ♫

40:37.290 --> 40:38.556
At first, I also thought that

40:38.580 --> 40:40.426
we were just returning the favors.

40:38.900 --> 40:42.226
♫ I feared the wind would blow away my fate ♫

40:40.450 --> 40:42.676
You helped me and I helped you.

40:42.250 --> 40:45.576
♫ People come and go ♫

40:44.810 --> 40:46.026
How about now?

40:45.600 --> 40:49.856
♫ Memories that cannot separate are the most regretful ♫

40:49.430 --> 40:50.476
What do you think?

40:50.050 --> 40:56.676
♫ The deeper the love, the more fate tortures us ♫

40:54.050 --> 40:55.500
You broke a rule.

40:56.700 --> 41:00.116
♫ The wind blows tens of thousands of miles ♫

41:00.140 --> 41:03.486
♫ Swinging the whip, I ride the horse into battle ♫

41:03.510 --> 41:08.856
♫ I only hear sighs tonight in the tall building ♫

41:04.600 --> 41:06.200
I have no regrets.

41:08.880 --> 41:12.326
♫ People come and go ♫

41:12.350 --> 41:16.856
♫ Leaving only two disappointing lines of poetry ♫

41:16.880 --> 41:24.590
♫ The deeper the love, the deeper one falls ♫
